{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Another Game About Automation</strong> is a casual factory-building and incremental game in which your goal is to generate increasingly larger numbers until you master exponential growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect mathematical operations, create logical chains, and discover the most efficient distribution to maximize your production. As you progress, you can improve your structures and unlock new operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and connect number generators with mathematical operations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new buildings and upgrade them by spending the points earned through numbers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the best combinations to generate huge numbers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your number production chain.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926510?t=1758965653","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926510?t=1758965653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/83ee9ce19ef1405bda13e81717ec4fb767e9e6eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758965653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/83ee9ce19ef1405bda13e81717ec4fb767e9e6eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758965653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Another Game About Automation</strong> is a casual factory-building and incremental game in which your goal is to generate increasingly larger numbers until you master expone